*Then he said unto me, Son of Adam, these bones are the whole house of Yashar'el (Israel): behold, they say, Our bones are dried, and our hope is lost: we are cut off for our parts. Therefore prophesy and say unto them, Thus saith Adonai Yahuah (the Lord GOD); Behold, O my people, I will open your graves, and cause you to come up out of your graves, and bring you into the land of Yashar'el (Israel). And ye shall know that I am Yahuah (LORD), when I have opened your graves, O my people, and brought you up out of your graves, And shall put my spirit in you, and ye shall live, and I shall place you in your own land: then shall ye know that I Yahuah (LORD) have spoken it, and performed it, saith Yahuah (LORD).* (Ezekiel 37:11-14)

