VALUES ((SELECT v.id FROM verses v JOIN chapters c ON c.id = v.chapter_id JOIN books b ON b.id = c.book_id JOIN editions e ON e.id = b.edition_id WHERE e.slug = 'canon' AND b.slug = 'exodus' AND c.chapter_number = 34 AND v.verse_number = 7), 'grace', 'Grace', 'By grace through faith — the name Yahuah (God) proclaimed of himself at Sinai', $card$*But Elohim (God), who is rich in mercy, for his great love wherewith he loved us, Even when we were dead in sins, hath quickened us together with Messiah (Christ), (by grace ye are saved;)* (Ephesians 2:4-5)

*For by grace are ye saved through faith; and that not of yourselves: it is the gift of Elohim (God): Not of works, lest any man should boast. For we are his workmanship, created in HaMashiach Yahusha (Christ Jesus) unto good works, which Elohim (God) hath before ordained that we should walk in them.* (Ephesians 2:8-10)

